<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Standard Bank unit appoints director.</title>
<headline>Standard Bank unit appoints director.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Standard Bank Ltd unit, Standard Corporate and Merchant Bank (SCMB), said on Wednesday Paul Smith had been appointed as director of its risk division.</p>
<p>The bank said in a statement Smith, a partner at KPMG Financial Services Group, would be responsible for credit, market and operational risk within SCMB.</p>
<p>The new position was created in the light of the increasing importance worldwide of overall risk management within banks like SCMB, it said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
